# Force HTTPS and www redirect
http://atteste.art/* https://atteste.art/:splat 301!
http://www.atteste.art/* https://atteste.art/:splat 301!
https://www.atteste.art/* https://atteste.art/:splat 301!

# Block direct access to internal strategy docs and operational scripts
# (robots.txt is advisory; this is the real gate)
/marketing/* /404.html 404!
/scripts/*   /404.html 404!
/.claude/*   /404.html 404!

# NFC tag verify URLs — taps on /v/{certId} are intercepted by the
# Atteste app via Universal Links / App Links (see /.well-known/
# apple-app-site-association and /assetlinks.json). When the app
# is NOT installed, the OS opens the URL in a browser; we redirect
# to the existing Firebase Hosting verify page so the cert still
# resolves. App-installed users never see this redirect — the OS
# routes the URL into the app before the network request fires.
/v/* https://atteste-b6409.web.app/verify/:splat 302
